Okay. I'm... I'm coming in.

31
00:03:21.017 --> 00:03:22.395
Okay.

32
00:03:22.419 --> 00:03:25.498
Exactly what happened?

33
00:03:25.522 --> 00:03:29.068
It's complicated and I
don't wish to discuss it.

34
00:03:29.092 --> 00:03:31.493
It's none of your concern.
Are you in danger?

35
00:03:33.247 --> 00:03:35.391
Walt.

36
00:03:35.415 --> 00:03:38.210
Walt. I need you

37
00:03:38.234 --> 00:03:40.647
