than thinking about
buying a damn car wash.

42
00:03:53.317 --> 00:03:54.578
Okay?

43
00:03:54.602 --> 00:03:56.729
So if you could just...

44
00:03:56.753 --> 00:03:58.620
Please.

45
00:04:01.091 --> 00:04:02.590
Okay.

46
00:04:04.161 --> 00:04:07.011
